   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Morning Light**: rare: 14 archived performances [4]\n- **Sitting In Limbo**: rare: 8 archived performances [4]\n- **Last Train To Clarskville**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Raleigh and Spencer**: back after 84 archived shows (749 days) [4]\n- **Guitar Peace**: back after 48 archived shows (597 days) [4]\n- **Spinning**: back after 31 archived shows (513 days) [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **bs2021-06-19.sibert.c2.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 22 songs; 142 min; rated 5/5 by 2 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Taper stood front of board, about 100 feet from stage, with the stand around 4.5 feet high, clamped to the barricade [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **bs2021-06-19.sibert.c2.flac16**: taped by Ryan Sibert; source: Behringer C-2 (DIN)> OCM Marantz PMD660 > wav (16/44.1) [1]",
